{"title":"Wellness Coach Roadmap","role":"Wellness Coach","summary":"A Wellness Coach helps individuals develop sustainable habits related to nutrition, physical activity, sleep, stress management and overall lifestyle. With a background in Clinical Nutrition & Dietetics, the professional can bring evidence-based nutrition knowledge into wellness programs.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Clinical Nutrition & Dietetics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Wellness Coach helps individuals develop sustainable habits related to nutrition, physical activity, sleep, stress management and overall lifestyle. With a background in Clinical Nutrition & Dietetics, the professional can bring evidence-based nutrition knowledge into wellness programs."},{"type":"p","text":"The role may involve working with wellness centres, hospitals, gyms, corporate wellness programs, health-tech companies, fitness organizations, NGOs or private wellness practices."},{"type":"p","text":"The scope of practice should remain within the person's qualification and applicable professional regulations. A wellness coach should not independently diagnose diseases, prescribe medicines, or replace a physician, registered dietitian/dietitian, psychologist, or other licensed professional where those services are required."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Focus","Key Capabilities"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Nutrition foundations"},{"text":"Food science, anatomy, physiology"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Applied nutrition"},{"text":"Diet assessment, lifestyle counselling"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Clinical & community nutrition"},{"text":"Nutrition planning, behaviour change"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Wellness practice"},{"text":"Coaching, program design, client management"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Wellness Coach / Nutrition Coach"},{"text":"Client support and lifestyle programs"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Senior Wellness Coach"},{"text":"Personalized wellness programs"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Wellness Program Manager"},{"text":"Team and program management"}],[{"text":"7+ Years"},{"text":"Wellness Consultant / Program Lead"},{"text":"Strategic wellness leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-Wise Learning Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Nutrition & Health Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Food science"},{"text":"Fundamentals of nutrition"},{"text":"Macronutrients"},{"text":"Micronutrients"},{"text":"Human metabolism"},{"text":"Basic psychology"},{"text":"Health and wellness concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Presentation skills"},{"text":"Basic counselling"},{"text":"Health education"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Gain familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition assessment"},{"text":"Food diaries"},{"text":"Dietary patterns"},{"text":"Healthy meal planning"},{"text":"Lifestyle assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Applied Nutrition & Behaviour Change"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical nutrition fundamentals"},{"text":"Community nutrition"},{"text":"Sports nutrition basics"},{"text":"Weight management"},{"text":"Nutrition across the life cycle"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Therapeutic-diet concepts"},{"text":"Nutrition deficiencies"},{"text":"Lifestyle-related health conditions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Coaching skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Motivational interviewing"},{"text":"Goal setting"},{"text":"Habit formation"},{"text":"Behaviour-change principles"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Progress tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical project"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle & Nutrition Assessment Study"},{"type":"h","text":"Assess a group of participants for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dietary habits"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"BMI/body-composition indicators where appropriate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then design a structured wellness-improvement plan."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Clinical Nutrition & Wellness Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Obesity and weight management"},{"text":"Diabetes nutrition"},{"text":"Cardiovascular-health nutrition"},{"text":"Sports and exercise nutrition"},{"text":"Women's nutrition"},{"text":"Geriatric nutrition"},{"text":"Gut-health concepts"},{"text":"Community nutrition"},{"text":"Preventive nutrition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to conduct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Initial assessment"},{"text":"Goal setting"},{"text":"Lifestyle planning"},{"text":"Behaviour-change intervention"},{"text":"Progress monitoring"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Program adjustment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Nutrition tracking platforms"},{"text":"Health apps"},{"text":"Basic Power BI"},{"text":"Digital client records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Wellness Coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"Core capabilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personalized wellness planning"},{"text":"Client onboarding"},{"text":"Coaching conversations"},{"text":"Habit tracking"},{"text":"Group wellness programs"},{"text":"Corporate wellness"},{"text":"Health education"},{"text":"Program evaluation"},{"text":"Client retention"},{"text":"Ethical practice"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Design and Evaluate a Lifestyle Wellness Intervention\""},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Baseline Lifestyle Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify Behavioural Risk Factors"},{"type":"h","text":"Set Individual Wellness Goals"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition","Activity","Sleep Plan"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Weekly Coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"Progress Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Outcome Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Career / Process Flow"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition & Dietetics UG"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition / Wellness Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Coach Trainee"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Coach"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Wellness Coach"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Program Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Program Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Consultant / Program Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Skill-Gap Analysis"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Required Competency","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"Nutrition"},{"text":"Evidence-based nutrition fundamentals"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Diet assessment"},{"text":"Food intake and lifestyle assessment"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Habit-building techniques"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Active listening and client counselling"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Coaching"},{"text":"Goal setting and accountability"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Weight management"},{"text":"Lifestyle-based approaches"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Exercise knowledge"},{"text":"Basic exercise and activity principles"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Psychology"},{"text":"Behavioural and motivational concepts"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Client management"},{"text":"Follow-ups and progress tracking"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Data skills"},{"text":"Excel and basic analytics"},{"text":"Medium"}],[{"text":"Digital health"},{"text":"Wellness apps and tracking systems"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Scope-of-practice awareness"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Client management and program design"},{"text":"Medium–High"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Projects"}]},{"heading":"Personalized Wellness Planner","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Build a structured system that records:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Age"},{"text":"Lifestyle"},{"text":"Dietary patterns"},{"text":"Activity level"},{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Wellness goals"},{"text":"Progress indicators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"and generates a coach-supervised wellness plan."}]},{"heading":"Weight-Management Behaviour Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Study how:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food habits"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"Screen time"}]},{"type":"p","text":"affect weight-management behaviours."}]},{"heading":"Corporate Wellness Program","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Design a 12-week employee wellness program covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Stress management"},{"text":"Hydration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Track participation and outcomes."}]},{"heading":"Nutrition & Lifestyle Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI/Excel dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Participant progress"},{"text":"Activity levels"},{"text":"Goal completion"},{"text":"Weight trends"},{"text":"Sleep patterns"},{"text":"Program engagement"}]}]},{"heading":"Community Wellness Campaign","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design an awareness program around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthy eating"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Obesity prevention"},{"text":"Sleep hygiene"},{"text":"Stress management"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blo