& Lifestyle Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Wellness Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Wellness Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Strategy Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Powered Wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"AI can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lifestyle pattern analysis"},{"text":"Personalized habit recommendations"},{"text":"Progress tracking"},{"text":"Engagement reminders"},{"text":"Risk identification"},{"text":"Wellness-program personalization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should support—not replace—qualified professional judgement."},{"type":"h","text":"Wearable Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Wearables can provide information about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Activity"},{"text":"Heart rate"},{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Exercise"},{"text":"Recovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Wellness professionals can use these data streams to support behaviour-change programs within appropriate professional boundaries."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"Growing areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tele-coaching"},{"text":"Mobile wellness platforms"},{"text":"Digital nutrition tracking"},{"text":"Remote lifestyle programs"},{"text":"AI-assisted wellness platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future-Ready Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Behaviour Change"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Motivational Interviewing"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Education"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Health"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Wearable Data"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel / Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Management"},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly strong 2026+ positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition","Behaviour Change","Digital Wellness","Health Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Suggested Development Plan"},{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary Objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Nutrition and health foundations"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Applied nutrition + behaviour change"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Clinical/community nutrition + coaching"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Wellness program design + professional practice"}],[{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Gain supervised client and program experience"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Build coaching and client-management expertise"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Specialize in corporate, digital or preventive wellness"}],[{"text":"5+ Years"},{"text":"Move toward consulting or wellness program leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Graduation Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain core nutrition principles"},{"text":"Conduct basic lifestyle assessments"},{"text":"Understand dietary patterns and nutritional risk factors"},{"text":"Support healthy behaviour change"},{"text":"Set realistic wellness goals"},{"text":"Use motivational interviewing techniques"},{"text":"Conduct structured wellness-coaching sessions"},{"text":"Track client progress"},{"text":"Design group wellness programs"},{"text":"Deliver nutrition and health-education sessions"},{"text":"Understand basic exercise and physical-activity principles"},{"text":"Use Excel for client/program tracking"},{"text":"Understand digital health and wearable data"},{"text":"Maintain professional documentation"},{"text":"Protect client confidentiality"},{"text":"Recognize when a client requires referral to a qualified clinician"},{"text":"Work effectively with multidisciplinary healthcare teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical Nutrition & Dietetics Graduate","Wellness Coaching","Behaviour Change","Preventive Health","Digital Wellness"],"sep":"+","label":"Best positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination positions the graduate for wellness coaching, corporate wellness, preventive-health programs, health-tech, nutrition education and wellness consulting, while providing a pathway toward specialized postgraduate study in nutrition, public health, sports nutrition or healthcare management."}]}]}